      "source": "sections/sec-011-6-management-of-anaphylaxis-and-anxiety-related.md",
      "source_hash": "a8ec1641194284f976539bc49418810eb6482cd30767bfea701c5afed4257e5c",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Advises that staff, equipment and medicines to manage anaphylaxis and anxiety-related reactions be on hand, with precautions against injury from fainting.",
